	"documentation": "Frozen, shrink-only baseline for test/suite/no-sync-in-session-path.test.ts (senpi#3676). Every synchronous fs, crypto or zlib call reachable from the RPC session path, outside the three whole-file APIs the ledger tracks and outside the move path (which allows none). Keyed by (file, declared callee, enclosing symbol) with the exact call count. The test fails on any site not listed here (adding one is forbidden: make the new call asynchronous) and on any listed entry that no longer occurs at that count (remove or lower it in the same PR). It may only shrink, to zero. Sorted by codepoint; counts are call sites. The one addition after the first snapshot, made in #3991 when the audit learned the bind/alias forms, is src/utils/photon.ts readFileSync in patchPhotonWasmRead (see its reason).",
